      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Drones",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Drones</strong> on the thumb bar. ATAK's tools menu has <strong>Drones</strong> too.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a0cb5e2c31123738.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick your role",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The first time, <strong>Drones</strong> asks <strong>Your role</strong>. Tap yours, here <strong>Drone team</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2144284fcdd5d5d6.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick your unit",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>With no unit set, OpenDefence Main asks for <strong>My unit</strong>. Tap <strong>›</strong> next to your platoon, here <strong>1J</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5564184c36f1896f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick your team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Inside the platoon, tap your team, here <strong>2R</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6b0414327d4f8310.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See your first page",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Your role's pages are the tabs at the bottom. A drone team starts on <strong>Requests</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3932c69873119205.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check it in Settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Settings</strong> shows your <strong>Role</strong> and <strong>Unit</strong>. Tap another role, or <strong>Pick</strong> for another unit.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6f4fd72b93bcf2f0.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
